sequenceDiagram
    title BLE GATT Read/Write Example: Pulse Oximeter Features and Notifications

    participant App as App<br>[implements GattClientResponse]
    participant Node as Node<br>[implements GattClient]
    participant Peripheral as Pulse Oximeter<br>BLE Peripheral

    Note over Node, Peripheral: Messages between Node and BLE Peripheral<br>are link-layer / ATT events, not driven by the App.<br>The App only observes them through Echo callbacks.

    rect rgb(230, 230, 240)
        note over App, Peripheral: Read PLX Features characteristic
        App->>Node: GattClient.ReadCharacteristic(69)
        Node-)Peripheral: ATT_READ_REQ (handle=69)
        Peripheral-)Node: ATT_READ_RSP (0x0073)
        Node-->>App: GattClientResponse.ReadCharacteristicResponse(<br>data={handle=69, data=0x0073})
        Node-->>App: GattClientResponse.OperationComplete(success)

        note over App: PLX Features = 0x0073.<br>Bits 0, 1, 4, 5, 6 = Measurement Status support,<br>Device and Sensor Status support, SpO2PR-Fast,<br>SpO2PR-Slow, and Pulse Amplitude Index<br>(PLX Service Spec 1.0.1, Section 3.4.1).
    end

    rect rgb(230, 230, 240)
        note over App, Peripheral: Enable notifications on PLX Continuous Measurement
        App->>Node: GattClient.WriteDescriptor(<br>handle=67, data=0x0100)
        Node-)Peripheral: ATT_WRITE_REQ (handle=67, value=0x0100)
        Peripheral-)Node: ATT_WRITE_RSP
        Node-->>App: GattClientResponse.OperationComplete(success)

        note over App: Wrote 0x0100 to CCCD (handle 67).<br>Notifications are now enabled for value handle 66.
    end

    rect rgb(230, 230, 240)
        note over App, Peripheral: Read back CCCD to confirm subscription
        App->>Node: GattClient.ReadDescriptor(67)
        Node-)Peripheral: ATT_READ_REQ (handle=67)
        Peripheral-)Node: ATT_READ_RSP (0x0100)
        Node-->>App: GattClientResponse.ReadDescriptorResponse(<br>data={handle=67, data=0x0100})
        Node-->>App: GattClientResponse.OperationComplete(success)

        note over App: CCCD reads back 0x0100, confirming notifications are enabled.
    end
